{"_metadata": true, "scale_id": "iri", "scale_name": "Interpersonal Reactivity Index (IRI)", "scale_name_zh": "同理心量表", "n_items": 28, "response_range": [1, 5], "response_labels": ["非常不同意", "不同意", "無意見", "同意", "非常同意"], "instruction": "請你針對以下敘述，評量你同意每個敘述的程度。", "instruction_en": "The following statements inquire about your thoughts and feelings in a variety of situations. Indicate how well each statement describes you.", "reverse_items": [3,4,7,12,13,14,15,18,19], "subscales": [{"name": "Perspective_taking", "items": [3,8,11,15,21,25,28], "scoring": "mean"}, {"name": "Fantasy", "items": [1,5,7,12,16,23,26], "scoring": "mean"}, {"name": "Empathic_concern", "items": [2,4,9,14,18,20,22], "scoring": "mean"}, {"name": "Personal_distress", "items": [6,10,13,17,19,24,27], "scoring": "mean"}]}
{"item_id": "iri_01", "item_number": 1, "text": "我常常做白日夢或幻想一些可能發生在我身上的事。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Fantasy"}
{"item_id": "iri_02", "item_number": 2, "text": "我時常對那些比我不幸的人懷有溫柔和關懷的情感。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Empathic_concern"}
{"item_id": "iri_03", "item_number": 3, "text": "有時候我發現自己難以從「他人」角度看待事情。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": true, "subscale": "Perspective_taking"}
{"item_id": "iri_04", "item_number": 4, "text": "當其他人遭遇困難時，有時候我不會感到抱歉或遺憾。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": true, "subscale": "Empathic_concern"}
{"item_id": "iri_05", "item_number": 5, "text": "我確實會對小說中的角色感同身受。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Fantasy"}
{"item_id": "iri_06", "item_number": 6, "text": "在緊急情況下，我會感到憂慮和不安。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Personal_distress"}
{"item_id": "iri_07", "item_number": 7, "text": "當我看電影或玩遊戲時，我通常是客觀的，而且時常不會完全陷入其中。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": true, "subscale": "Fantasy"}
{"item_id": "iri_08", "item_number": 8, "text": "在做出決定之前，我試著去看每個人意見分歧的地方。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Perspective_taking"}
{"item_id": "iri_09", "item_number": 9, "text": "當我看到有人被利用時，我會有種想保護他們的感覺。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Empathic_concern"}
{"item_id": "iri_10", "item_number": 10, "text": "當我身處非常情緒化的情況時，有時我會感到無助。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Personal_distress"}
{"item_id": "iri_11", "item_number": 11, "text": "有時候我會試著從我朋友的角度來看待事物，好讓我更了解我的朋友。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Perspective_taking"}
{"item_id": "iri_12", "item_number": 12, "text": "深刻地投入一本好書或一部電影對我來說是很少見的。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": true, "subscale": "Fantasy"}
{"item_id": "iri_13", "item_number": 13, "text": "當我看到有人受傷時，我傾向保持冷靜。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": true, "subscale": "Personal_distress"}
{"item_id": "iri_14", "item_number": 14, "text": "其他人的不幸通常不會困擾我很久。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": true, "subscale": "Empathic_concern"}
{"item_id": "iri_15", "item_number": 15, "text": "如果在某件事上我確定自己是正確的，我就不會浪費太多時間傾聽別人的想法。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": true, "subscale": "Perspective_taking"}
{"item_id": "iri_16", "item_number": 16, "text": "看了一場戲或一部電影後。我覺得自己好像是其中的一個角色。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Fantasy"}
{"item_id": "iri_17", "item_number": 17, "text": "處於緊張的情緒狀態讓我感到害怕。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Personal_distress"}
{"item_id": "iri_18", "item_number": 18, "text": "當我看到有人受到不公平待遇時，有時候我不會對他們產生太多的憐憫。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": true, "subscale": "Empathic_concern"}
{"item_id": "iri_19", "item_number": 19, "text": "在處於緊急情況時，我通常相當有效率。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": true, "subscale": "Personal_distress"}
{"item_id": "iri_20", "item_number": 20, "text": "我常常被我所看到事物感動。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Empathic_concern"}
{"item_id": "iri_21", "item_number": 21, "text": "我相信美惡問題都有兩個面向，並且會試圖去看清每一個面向。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Perspective_taking"}
{"item_id": "iri_22", "item_number": 22, "text": "我會形容自己是一個相當心軟的人。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Empathic_concern"}
{"item_id": "iri_23", "item_number": 23, "text": "當我看一部好電影時，我可以很容易地將自己置於主角的位置。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Fantasy"}
{"item_id": "iri_24", "item_number": 24, "text": "我在緊急情況下往往會失控。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Personal_distress"}
{"item_id": "iri_25", "item_number": 25, "text": "當我對某人感到難過時，我通常會試著花一點時間設身處地、想像如果我是他（她）。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Perspective_taking"}
{"item_id": "iri_26", "item_number": 26, "text": "當我在讀一篇有趣的故事或小說時，我會想像如果故事中的事件發生在我身上，我的感覺如何。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Fantasy"}
{"item_id": "iri_27", "item_number": 27, "text": "當我看到有人遭遇緊急情況、急需幫助時，我會感到崩潰、心碎。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Personal_distress"}
{"item_id": "iri_28", "item_number": 28, "text": "在批評別人之前，我會試著想像一下，如果我是他（她），我的感受如何。", "text_en": null, "response_options": [1,2,3,4,5], "reverse_coded": false, "subscale": "Perspective_taking"}
